      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is option to add warning mark above the name bar (like other icons) if the player cannot move easily and will swap between loading screen VRChat and game. This is common problem if your PC is not powerful enough and your room is very busy.\n\nSame if your headset crashed and you're still in the game, others cannot reach you. Then here keyboard press should send signal to VRChat and pop up above name bar as warning icon...",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
